source: Corne J, Carroll M, Brown I, Delany D. Chest X-ray Made Easy. 4th ed. Edinburgh: Elsevier; 2016. || chest x-ray made easy
source: Chan O, ed. ABC of Emergency Radiology. 3rd ed. Chichester: Wiley-Blackwell (BMJ Books); 2013. || ABC of emergency radiology chest
